    <div>
      <h1>Amar Razzaq</h1>
      <p class="role">Associate Professor of Agricultural Economics<br>Business School, Huanggang Normal University, China</p>
      <p>I am an agricultural and food economist working mainly on Pakistan, China and the wider Asian region. My research covers water and groundwater markets, agricultural productivity and climate risk, food security and nutrition, consumer behaviour in food markets, and rural finance, with a focus on what these mean for policy. I received my PhD in Agricultural Economics from Huazhong Agricultural University in 2021.</p>
      <p>I have also worked as a consultant to the Asian Development Bank, and I write short policy commentaries on Pakistan's farm economy.</p>
      <p class="contact">
        <a href="mailto:amar.razzaq@hotmail.com">amar.razzaq@hotmail.com</a> ·
        <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=Mt2iircAAAAJ&amp;hl=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Scholar</a> ·
        <a href="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8858-2417" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ORCID</a> ·
        <a href="https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Amar-Razzaq-3" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ResearchGate</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section>
    <h2 class="section-title">Selected publications</h2>
{%- set featured = ["10.1016/j.scitotenv.2019.02.266", "10.1016/j.cliser.2026.100765", "10.1016/j.ijdrr.2024.104642", "10.1016/j.jretconser.2021.102556", "10.1111/cjag.12184", "10.1038/s41598-024-63445-6"] %}
    <ul class="plain-list pubs">
{%- for group in publications %}{% for p in group.papers %}{% if p.doi in featured %}
      <li><a class="t" href="https://doi.org/{{ p.doi }}">{{ p.title }}</a><span class="m">{% for a in p.authors %}{% if a == "Razzaq, A." %}<strong>{{ a }}</strong>{% else %}{{ a }}{% endif %}{% if not loop.last %}{% if loop.revindex0 == 1 %} &amp; {% else %}, {% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %} ({{ p.year }}). <em>{{ p.journal }}</em>.</span></li>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}{% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p class="more"><a href="/research/">All publications &rarr;</a></p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="section-title">Recent policy writing</h2>
